    "enUS": {
      "description": "A lingering demon presence remains to the east. Among them are the hellish beasts responsible for ravaging our kin, siphoning their power to use it against our allies.\r\n\r\nPenetrate their camp, locate these beasts and slay them. Retrieve any samples that remain.\r\n\r\nPerhaps there is something we can learn from these efforts.",
